# Resi idles on the St. Wolfgang quay for 16094 frames, then takes the
# solver's notch hop (RB 64, RBJ 36): the camera reaches column 8 and the
# scroll starts in step 16200, the same step the timer (270 s = 16200
# frames) runs out. She dies (TimeUp) with the camera at x 128 in the
# scroll, respawns at the start (no checkpoint yet) at 16260 with the
# camera back in the lead-in (x 0) and the level reset, and the second
# hop starts the scroll again: she lands on the Dampfer, which leaves
# again (it was reset to its waiting spawn) and carries her to x >= 570.
